{
 "html": "<section data-bg=\"grid\" aria-labelledby=\"about-title\" style=\"position: relative; overflow: clip; padding-block: clamp(var(--space-8), 5vw, var(--space-16)) clamp(var(--space-12), 8vw, var(--space-20));\">\n    <div aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"position: absolute; inset-block-start: -30%; inset-inline-end: -10%; inline-size: min(50vw, 560px); aspect-ratio: 1 / 1; border-radius: var(--radius-pill); background: var(--glow-cyan); pointer-events: none;\"></div>\n    <div data-stack=\"\" class=\"cory-container\" data-hero-split=\"\" style=\"position: relative; display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0px, 1fr) minmax(0px, 1fr); gap: var(--space-10) var(--space-12); align-items: center;\">\n      <div style=\"display: grid; gap: var(--space-5); min-inline-size: 0px;\">\n        <p data-hero-el=\"\" class=\"cory-overline\" style=\"margin: 0px;\">About</p>\n        <h1 id=\"about-title\" data-hero-title=\"\" style=\"margin: 0px; max-inline-size: 18ch; font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: var(--weight-extrabold); font-size: var(--text-fluid-display); line-height: var(--leading-snug); letter-spacing: var(--tracking-tighter); color: var(--text-strong); overflow-wrap: anywhere;\">I make AI feel like something you can <span style=\"background: var(--gradient-text); -webkit-background-clip: text; background-clip: text; color: transparent;\">rely on</span>.</h1>\n        <p data-hero-el=\"\" style=\"margin: 0px; max-inline-size: var(--measure-lead); font-size: clamp(var(--text-body), 1.6vw, var(--text-body-lg)); line-height: var(--leading-relaxed); color: var(--text-body); text-wrap: pretty;\">I'm Mohammad Abdul Aleem, AIUXAleem online: an AI-first Senior Product Designer in Hyderabad. Thirteen-plus years in enterprise UX taught me that trust is a design outcome: clear states, honest copy, accessible components and systems that behave the same way every time.</p>\n        <div data-hero-el=\"\" data-hero-ctas=\"\" style=\"display: flex; gap: var(--space-3); flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center;\">\n          <div class=\"sc-host-x\" style=\"display: contents;\"><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/uc?export=download&amp;id=1cmkjeMQc1S9gIePpRh29T4nFkBBe3izm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"View resume (PDF, opens in a new tab)\" style=\"position: relative; display: inline-flex; width: auto; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 10px; padding: 15px 30px; min-height: 52px; font-size: var(--text-ui-lg); font-family: var(--font-sans); font-weight: var(--weight-semibold); line-height: 1; letter-spacing: var(--tracking-ui); border-radius: var(--radius-pill); text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer; opacity: 1; transition: transform var(--duration-fast) var(--ease-out), box-shadow var(--duration-base) var(--ease-out), background var(--duration-base) var(--ease-out), filter var(--duration-base) var(--ease-out), color var(--duration-base) var(--ease-out); white-space: nowrap; transform: none; background: var(--gradient-brand-deep); color: var(--text-on-brand); box-shadow: var(--shadow-brand); border: 1px solid transparent;\" data-ds-button=\"primary\"><span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; visibility: visible;\">View resume</span></a></div>\n          <a data-link=\"\" href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/aiuxaleem\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-1); min-block-size: var(--tap-target); padding-inline: var(--space-2); font-size: var(--text-body-md); font-weight: var(--weight-semibold); color: var(--text-link); text-decoration: none;\">LinkedIn <svg data-dir-icon=\"\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M8 7h9v9\"></path></svg></a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div data-hero-el=\"\" data-hero-stage=\"\" data-cq=\"\" style=\"position: relative; inline-size: 100%; max-inline-size: 520px; justify-self: end; aspect-ratio: 1 / 1; min-inline-size: 0px;\">\n        <div aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"position: absolute; inset: 0px; border-radius: 50%; background: repeating-radial-gradient(circle at center, var(--border-default) 0 1px, transparent 1px 11%); mask-image: radial-gradient(circle, rgb(0, 0, 0) 0%, transparent 72%); pointer-events: none;\"></div>\n        <div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"cory-glow-drift\" style=\"position: absolute; inset: 12%; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--glow-cyan-strong); pointer-events: none;\"></div>\n        <div style=\"position: absolute; inset-block-start: 10%; inset-inline-start: 21%; inline-size: 58%; aspect-ratio: var(--aspect-portrait); border-radius: var(--radius-2xl); overflow: hidden; background: var(--gradient-ink); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);\"><div style=\"position: absolute; inset: 0px;\"><span data-image-box=\"about-portrait\" data-alt=\"Portrait\" style=\"display:block;position:relative;inline-size:100%;block-size:100%;aspect-ratio:3/2;overflow:hidden;\"><img src=\"/assets/author-portrait.jpg\" alt=\"Portrait\" width=\"836\" height=\"836\" style=\"position:absolute;display:block;max-width:none;left:50%;top:50%;width:100%;height:100%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);object-fit:cover;\"></span></div></div>\n        <span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"position: absolute; inset-block-start: 14%; inset-inline-end: 7%; inline-size: clamp(36px, 10cqi, 52px); block-size: clamp(36px, 10cqi, 52px); display: grid; place-items: center; border-radius: var(--radius-lg); background: var(--gradient-ink); border: 1px solid var(--border-default); color: var(--on-ink-strong); box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"inline-size: 46%; block-size: 46%;\"><path d=\"M